{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 55 — APIs & Containerization: Dockerize a prediction service\n","Objectives:\n","- Package your FastAPI model API (from Day 44).\n","- Create a minimal Dockerfile.\n","- Build and run locally; test with curl.\n","Note: You need Docker Desktop or a Docker runtime installed to build images."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Project layout\n","````\n","ds-60day/\n","  app.py               # from Day 44 (FastAPI)\n","  model.joblib         # saved model\n","  requirements-api.txt # smaller requirements for API runtime\n","  Dockerfile\n","````"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Example requirements-api.txt\n","```text\n","fastapi\n","uvicorn\n","joblib\n","numpy\n","scikit-learn\n","pydantic\n","```\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Example Dockerfile\n","```Dockerfile\n","# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1\n","FROM python:3.11-slim\n","WORKDIR /app\n","COPY requirements-api.txt ./\n","RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements-api.txt\n","COPY app.py model.joblib ./\n","EXPOSE 8000\n","CMD [\"uvicorn\", \"app:app\", \"--host\", \"0.0.0.0\", \"--port\", \"8000\"]\n","```\n","Build & run:\n","```bash\n","docker build -t ds-60day-api .\n","docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 ds-60day-api\n","```\n","Test:\n","```bash\n","curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict \\\n","  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n","  -d '{"features": [5.1, 3.5, 1.4, 0.2]}'\n","```\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Create a slim requirements file that includes only what the API needs.\n","2) Add a health endpoint `/health` that returns `{status: \"ok\"}`.\n","3) Push your image to a registry (Docker Hub/GHCR) if you have an account."]}]}
